  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 451(a), a cash-basis taxpayer reports income in the year it is actually or constructively received, regardless of when earned. Henderson''s $5,000 rental payment received and deposited in December 2025 is included in 2025 gross income even though it represents January 2026 rent.
