  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under the Restatement (Third) of Agency, an agent owes fiduciary duties of loyalty (Section 8.01), obedience, care, accounting, and notification. However, independently setting strategic direction and business objectives is a management responsibility belonging to the principal, not a fiduciary duty owed by the agent.
