  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Patterson faces three distinct tax rates on these gains. The building''s $300,000 attributable to straight-line depreciation is unrecaptured Section 1250 gain taxed at a maximum 25% rate. The remaining $100,000 of building gain is taxed at standard LTCG rates (15% or 20%). The equipment''s entire $80,000 gain is ordinary income under Section 1245 full recapture.
